      "body": "PR #526 is merged. Merged the independently reviewed I03.var08 v1.0.0 package to simlox/main at `33193ce8ce5763d9dd892eda9c68ab9d729c8a3a`, exact reviewed head `915238fa96463983e37bb3a8697ac4ea718099a1`. Content, staged and remote GO gates passed. Fetched merged audit: 195 changed paths, all 194 case blobs byte-equal to frozen disk; catalog496 preserves prior495 entries and metadata recursively type-exact. Disk CRLF and Git LF remain distinct identities.\n\nOne unique serial SSH session0 child completed naturally under the existing mutex and fresh GUI13340/session1/start1790590196826 guards; no accepted parent rerun. The source adds only PDESC and one P-CREW OUT row at h24.75/quantity1/TFDT0 after preparation releases at24.5 and printed MAXUT remaining0. Nominal quantity reduces2→1 at request; physical local quantity reduces2→1 at positive start, once; arrival causes no second decrement. Terminal local/nominal1, booked/reserved/pending/BO0, ready aircraft2; mission28–29 unchanged. Independent sealed replay checks113 typed timed events, all5210 child report cells and55 predeclared paired differences. Accepted-parent raw is byte-bound and its5210-cell derivation was reviewed at contract stage.\n\nIndex159257 bytes SHA256 `2fa2074ea451e825d3b7f0ffdff8ef1db6512606d07240c072835b4f7e577a5f` retains192 sources,147 mandatory accepted/native originals plus15 separate zero-native preflight originals,81 accepted disk/Git pairs,85 frozen execution sources and287 manifest records. Original source/raw/failure pins are preserved. Merged audit81942 bytes SHA256 `ca47b7a84a2df3cd78081358b801d303940470fbd45aa4c4aef821a122ae484f`. Remote GO SHA256 `a1558b240da06c63084b1106131a9b6f329b7c83c87e2f669eb144e003697d01`.\n\nThree CI workflows/jobs failed, fetched steps[]/job logs_url=null; no CI pass or cause claim. Default and CR-aware style exit2 preserved; CR-aware11 diagnostics in11 frozen paths, no clean claim. One attachment attempt failed at100-item cap, no retry/removal. Reviewer remote audit v1 phrase-check failure remains preserved as decoded-text-only evidence; v2 changes that phrase predicate only and passed the full audit. No native retry.\n\nScope is this fixed source and original trace/report only, with no general MAXUT/OUT law, person identity, GUI, cross-engine or performance claim. Productmain remains `a1a44c72f64d754b711abe4095f1111f8a5ba896`. K01/K08 capture blockers remain without retries; I07 opening-stock-three remains excluded; M-B03 dictionary mapping blocker remains separate. Issue18 and its original goal are unfinished. Continuing live dependency/ownership checks here."
